        "q-1-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>The moment your order ships you will get an email and an SMS with a live tracking link. You can also check status any time under <strong>Account → Orders</strong>. Metros usually receive their parcel in 2–4 working days; the rest of India in 4–7.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-1-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship across India?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — every serviceable PIN code in India, through our courier partners. Orders above ₹699 ship free; below that a flat ₹49 applies at checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-1-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change or cancel my order after placing it?",
            "answer": "<p>If it has not been packed yet, email <a href=\"mailto:support@lumapause.com\">support@lumapause.com</a> with your order number and we will amend or cancel it. Once it is handed to the courier we cannot recall it — but you can refuse delivery and we will refund you in full.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-1-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Not yet. We are working on it. Join the newsletter and you will be the first to know when we open up shipping outside India.</p>"
          }
        },
        "category-2": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Products & Ingredients"
          }
        },
        "q-2-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who are Luma & Pause products for?",
            "answer": "<p>Our range is made for all hair, scalp and skin types. The Hair Growth Shampoo, Serum and Scalp Mist care for hair and scalp; the Face Mist and Daily Glow Moisturiser care for your skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-2-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the shampoo sulfate-free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our Hair Growth Shampoo is sulfate-free, so it cleanses dirt, oil and build-up without stripping the scalp. The full ingredient list (INCI) is printed on every pack — please check it if you have specific allergies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-2-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I build a routine?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Hair:</strong> cleanse with the Shampoo 2–3 times a week, then spray the Serum or Scalp Mist onto a clean, dry or towel-dried scalp and massage in. Do not rinse.<br><strong>Skin:</strong> spritz the Face Mist on clean skin, then apply the Daily Glow Moisturiser morning and night.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-2-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long before I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people notice a cleaner, fresher scalp and more comfortable skin straight away. For hair, give it 6–8 weeks of consistent use — healthy hair growth takes time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-2-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the products safe for sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Our formulas are gentle and doctor formulated, but everyone is different. Do a patch test before first use, avoid contact with eyes, and stop using if irritation occurs.</p>"
          }
        },
